{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '360,760p' tools/blender-vision-mcp/benchmarks/nocturne_one/evaluator/inspect_candidate.py\ngrep -R \\\"seal-nocturne-candidate\\\\|validate.*glb\\\\|application authority\\\\|application_authority\\\\|receipt\\\" -n tools/blender-vision-mcp/src tools/blender-vision-mcp/docs tools/blender-vision-mcp/benchmarks/nocturne_one | sed -n '1,360p'\nls -l /Applications/Blender.app/Contents/MacOS/Blender 2>/dev/null || true\nuv run bvmcp --help\nuv run bvmcp benchmark --help\"","aggregated_output":"usage: bvmcp [-h]\n             {doctor,capabilities,capability,app,browser,glb,model,serve,daemon,project,reference,measurement,feature,material,component,blender,vision,dataset,validate,receipt,workflow,benchmark,repair,review,worker,job,status,jobs,cache}\n             ...\n\nBlender Vision MCP coordinator\n\npositional arguments:\n  {doctor,capabilities,capability,app,browser,glb,model,serve,daemon,project,reference,measurement,feature,material,component,blender,vision,dataset,validate,receipt,workflow,benchmark,repair,review,worker,job,status,jobs,cache}\n    doctor              discover Blender, vision, and media capabilities\n    capabilities        show registered model backends\n    capability          evaluate the evidence-bound 0–110 capability authority\n    app                 compile governed application reference packets\n    browser             run governed cross-browser and environment-state\n                        verification\n    glb                 validate GLB 2.0 structure without external fetches\n    model               govern manually acquired model checkpoints\n    serve               start the MCP server\n    daemon              run a local SQLite job coordinator\n    project             project lifecycle\n    reference           reference evidence\n    measurement         metric evidence\n    feature             technical feature evidence and review\n    material            appearance evidence and named review\n    component           typed parametric components and fitting\n    blender             headless Blender operations\n    vision              vision backends\n    dataset             synthetic data and feature-model training\n    validate            reference/render validation\n    receipt             acceptance receipts\n    workflow            high-level reconstruction workflows\n    benchmark           bootstrap governed benchmark projects\n    repair              evidence-bound repair proposals and checkpoints\n    review              loopback-only browser review application\n    worker              distributed worker enrollment and lease recovery\n    job                 job state and cancellation\n    status              project status\n    jobs                recent jobs\n    cache               cache inspection\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\nusage: bvmcp benchmark [-h]\n                       {bootstrap-mac-studio,bootstrap-calibration,bootstrap-asset-preparation,bootstrap-appearance,bootstrap-performance,bootstrap-distributed-runtime,bootstrap-adversarial,bootstrap-nocturne-oracle,evaluate-nocturne-3d,evaluate-nocturne-app,seal-nocturne-candidate,bootstrap-dgx-spark,bootstrap-rtx-5090-fe,revise-rtx-5090-fe,refine-rtx-5090-fe-visual,refine-rtx-5090-fe-front-frame,refine-dgx-spark-visual,refine-dgx-spark-base-foot}\n                       ...\n\npositional arguments:\n  {bootstrap-mac-studio,bootstrap-calibration,bootstrap-asset-preparation,bootstrap-appearance,bootstrap-performance,bootstrap-distributed-runtime,bootstrap-adversarial,bootstrap-nocturne-oracle,evaluate-nocturne-3d,evaluate-nocturne-app,seal-nocturne-candidate,bootstrap-dgx-spark,bootstrap-rtx-5090-fe,revise-rtx-5090-fe,refine-rtx-5090-fe-visual,refine-rtx-5090-fe-front-frame,refine-dgx-spark-visual,refine-dgx-spark-base-foot}\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and